255-# the banner down (measured at line 10 on STATUS-0.8.9.1.md). Here the ONLY
256-# board is CLOSED with its banner at line 9. A `head -n 5` reimplementation
257-# would call it LIVE and the briefing would exit 0; the shared 15-line window
258-# sees the banner, finds ZERO live boards, and HARD-fails.
